Z||000000||Neal||12-26-2001||01:19 AM||||For cristmas i got a digital camera so im gonna subjuct everyone to a bunch of aimless pics  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>Inside of the 3.4 that with fingers crossed will be in and running by the end of the week.<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/bottom_end.jpg"> <P>the outside of the 3.4<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/engine_2_1.jpg"> <P>Another blatent shot of the engine<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/engine_13.jpg"> <P>A shot of the relocated starter holes.  They came out a little crooked, even using the template, but the starter bolts up just fine.<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/starter_holes.jpg"> ||||reg||1
Z||000001||Neal||12-26-2001||01:23 AM||||Inside shot of the 3.4 oil pan, notice the lack of any baffels, but there is a windage tray.  The pan is deep and has a smallish area so after much deliberation no baffels were welded in.<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/inside_pan.jpg"> <P>The stock exaust wraped in thermo-tec ceramic wrap.<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/wraped_exaust.jpg"> <P>Auto meter Air/fuel and VDO 60psi fuel pressure guage<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/guages.jpg"> <P>And finally the lucky recipiant, well not so lucky covered in a layer of dirt and snow, adn has been off the road for a better part of the year.<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/side_view_car.jpg"> ||||reg||1
