Z||000008||Neal||12-26-2001||12:27 PM||||Thanks for the compliments.<P>First the cars in the back ground are<BR>White: 1991 or 3 Alfa 164S 3.0L V6, very nice car<BR>Red: early 70's Alfa spyder 2.0L 4cyl<BR>Yellow early 70's alfa GT jounior, 2.0L, set up for the track (worst street car ive driven but on the track  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> fully poly koni's BIG sway bars...), and JUST got back from a fresh coat of paint.<P>MY car, 87GT factory blue, have those wheels on for LAST winter with some snow tires.  Factory wheels are in the basement.  Ill get some shots of it later today.<P>The 3.4, stock compression, crane 2030 cam, fully balanced, cylinder bores matched to the pistons, shot peened crank and rods, a super nice valve grind, ported intake, and i think thats about it.<BR>BTW no ARP bolts.<P>Elinor84, nope i wasnt at the reddeer run.  Im hopefully going to make it out lots more in 2002.||||reg||1
